0. Status and scope

0.1 Mission class

This specification describes a robotic construction precursor: four surface vehicles, a fission power station, a battery bank, a non-pressurized prefabricated shelter, and a geotechnical inspection payload. No crew, no pressurized habitat, no life support, and no ascent vehicle are in this manifest. Crewed expansion is out of scope and would require a separate mass, power, and thermal budget.

