0.3 Consequence

No gate in this document can be closed. The mass table is hand-computed [C], not script-verified. The rotary-percussive penetrometer is flight heritage on other missions, not our hardware. The percussive force-reduction target is a target, not a measurement. The transient thermal model does not exist. The offload mechanism does not exist. The simulant bed does not exist.

The governing methodological rule, applied to this document itself:

A conditional calculation defines a test. It does not replace a measurement. No gate closes on arithmetic alone.

