7.3 Dual verdict

A platform is accepted only if both verdicts are positive:

1. Geometric conformity — slope, flatness, dimensions measured with stated uncertainty by lidar.
2. Geotechnical conformity — bearing and settlement measured with a validated protocol against pre-defined thresholds.

If verdict 2 is absent, no structural load may be placed on the platform. A level surface is not a load-bearing surface; cohesion varies by nearly two orders of magnitude across landed sites.

Status: OPEN. No penetrometer has been built. No simulant bed exists.

