Discharge operation ≥ −20 °C MER/JPL heritage 
Charging ≥ 0 °C; pre-heat below Lithium-plating constraint 

Capacity:

C_{\text{nom}} = \frac{80}{0.8 \times 0.9} = 111\ \text{kWh}

Mass at 120–150 Wh/kg: 740–930 kg.

